# Build context for MyVideoGameList.Server/Dockerfile, which is the repository root so that the
# root NuGet.Config applies. An allowlist: everything is excluded, then the two things the image
# needs are let back in, minus their build output. The client, the tests, the docs and .git never
# enter the context, so a local node_modules or bin/ cannot bloat a build or leak into an image.
*
!NuGet.Config
!MyVideoGameList.Server/
MyVideoGameList.Server/bin/
MyVideoGameList.Server/obj/
